+Word16 cos_fxp(Word16 x);
+
+//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+//	PURPOSE:
+//				Computes the sinus of x whose value is expressed in radians/PI.
+//
+//  INPUT:
+//              x - argument in Q1.15
+//
+//	OUTPUT:
+//		None
+//
+//	RETURN:
