+//     
+//
+//  INPUT:
+//		qval         - quantized value
+//      step_size    - step size used to quantize in unsigned Q0.16 format
+//      bit_num      - the number of bits
+//
+//	OUTPUT:
+//		None
+//
+//	RETURN:
